USER REPORTED: 0 mappings after batch 1
  Batch 1: 9/100, 1 mapping (some succeed before Stanza crash)
  Batch 2+: 0/100, 0 mappings (Stanza broken, ALL return None)

ROOT CAUSE (bukan threading!):
  When NLP(body) crashes:
    1. return None → entity_data DIBUANG (regex matches lost!)
    2. Stanza never recovers → ALL subsequent articles also return None
    3. Cascade failure: 0 mappings forever

FIX (both entity + context workers):
  1. Stanza crash → NO LONGER return None
     → Fallback to regex-only (entity still detected!)
     → doc = None, but found_matches tetap di-proses
  2. Reload Stanza on crash (recovery for next articles)
  3. If doc=None:
     - Skip semantic role check (has_sentiment_role=False)
     - Estimate sentence index from offset (no Stanza needed)
     - Context: basic sentence splitting (regex, no depparse)
  4. Entity tetap ter-deteksi via regex → mappings tetap terisi

BEFORE: Stanza crash → return None → 0 mappings → cascade failure
AFTER:  Stanza crash → fallback regex → mappings tetap ada → reload for next

IMPACT:
  Batch 1: 9/100 → 100/100 (Stza crash tidak kill batch)
  Batch 2+: 0/100 → 100/100 (regex fallback + reload)

Trade-off: Kalau Stanza crash, has_sentiment_role=False (less info)
  Tapi entity tetap ter-deteksi → mappings tetap ada → pipeline jalan!

Co-Authored-By: Z.ai Code
